{
    "compilerOptions": {
        // 目标语言的版本
        // "target": "ESNext",
        // 生成代码的模板标准
        // "module": "ESNext",
        "noEmit": false,
        "declaration": true,
        "declarationDir": "buildTypes",
        "outDir": "buildJs",
        "rootDir": "./",
        // TS2550: Property 'replaceAll' does not exist on type 'string'. Do you need to change your target library? Try changing the 'lib' compiler option to 'es2021' or later.
        "lib": ["ESNext", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable", "ScriptHost"],
        // TS1259: Module '"path"' can only be default-imported using the 'esModuleInterop' flag
        "esModuleInterop": true,
    },
    "include": ["./index.ts"],
    "exclude": ["buildJs","buildTypes"]
}
/*
noEmit , 若要导出d.ts文件，必须为false。否则会忽略declaration相关参数
declaration,是否导出d.ts文件，当为true时且noEmit为true时才会进行导出操作.
declarationDir，d.ts文件存放的目录路径。当不设置改参数时，将使用outDir的值
outDir，将typescript 转换成js文件、以及d.ts文件的存放目录
`tsconfig.json`当前目录执行`tsc`或`tsc --outDir js`指定目录
*/